1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,860
10,000 years ago, the Emperor's favourite son betrayed him.

2
00:00:06,528 --> 00:00:10,788
Horus, first son found, and the brightest.

3
00:00:11,138 --> 00:00:15,998
Warmaster of the Great Crusade, to conquer the stars.

4
00:00:16,348 --> 00:00:20,208
On Davin's moon, a blade struck him.

5
00:00:20,558 --> 00:00:25,618
As he lay dying, the dark gods whispered. And he listened.

6
00:00:27,165 --> 00:00:31,625
Half the Legions followed him into rebellion.

7
00:00:31,975 --> 00:00:36,035
They burned across the galaxy to Terra.

8
00:00:36,385 --> 00:00:40,712
Father and son met aboard Horus's flagship.

9
00:00:41,062 --> 00:00:46,589
Horus fell. The broken Emperor was sealed upon the Golden Throne.

10
00:00:47,576 --> 00:00:52,236
The Heresy was over. The long night had only begun.
